This is a multi-platform plugin **catalog** — marketplace manifests only, no
plugin source. All project policy, commands, key files, and off-limits live in
[AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md), which is the single source of truth. Edit the
Claude manifest (`.claude-plugin/marketplace.json`) only; run `make generate`
then `make validate` and commit the regenerated Codex/Cursor manifests. Do not
duplicate policy here.
